":"of a personal collection."},{"h":0.018618224225982249,"t":"ought to like.","c":1,"x":0.079957190135612061,"y":0.35624321343994225,"w":0.13432430267333986},{"t":"Of course, all hobbies give pleasure, but","h":0.018992932862190948,"c":1,"y":0.37500000038647774,"x":0.50617284363541459,"w":0.38888888041178393},{"c":1,"w":0.4037381998697917,"y":0.38982626109507745,"h":0.020154348672208555,"t":"Not all collectors are interested in learning","x":0.08006656961696966},{"w":0.39950927734374986,"x":0.50191288915754939,"y":0.3916306879283229,"h":0.019791202073383696,"t":"the common factor in collecting is usually","c":1},{"x":0.078189301075942602,"c":1,"h":0.017441860778592888,"y":0.409883720767521,"w":0.35596707661946614,"t":"from their hobby, though, so what we"},{"y":0.40883921810041701,"c":1,"h":0.020516105759691428,"x":0.50399635208230598,"w":0.35007148742675787,"t":"passion: pleasure is putting it far too"},{"y":0.42726737339924215,"c":1,"w":0.34773661295572916,"t":"might call a psychological reason for","x":0.080246919782639647,"h":0.017500068610632802},{"h":0.02075471417502317,"c":1,"y":0.4270359663200225,"t":"mildly. More than most other hobbies,","x":0.50390385387162084,"w":0.36679092407226555},{"x":0.08230453026338988,"t":"collecting is the need for a sense of","w":0.3374485524495443,"h":0.01472320376914027,"y":0.44611307447451987,"c":1},{"t":"collecting can be totally engrossing,","w":0.34809427897135425,"c":1,"x":0.50397127037729883,"h":0.020758692872819062,"y":0.44441619190900106},{"h":0.017491508569256853,"c":1,"w":0.38888888041178382,"t":"control, perhaps as a way of dealing with","x":0.0781893045655426,"y":0.4636627905353814},{"y":0.4636627905341757,"w":0.38065844217936184,"x":0.50411522322795699,"t":"and can give a strong sense of personal","h":0.017491508569256853,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.078037018560374025,"y":0.47960118242149463,"t":"insecurity. Stamp collectors, for instance,","w":0.38920763651529944,"h":0.020448866665573995},{"y":0.48016829053772225,"t":"fulfilment. To non-collectors it may appear","w":0.40587956746419274,"x":0.50180877999413553,"c":1,"h":0.020815322480577936},{"t":"arrange their stamps in albums, usually very an eccentric, if harmless, way of spending","x":0.07812352853667448,"y":0.49826854731945169,"w":0.82317901611328126,"h":0.020436532927065043,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.8087984212239584,"y":0.51570206150660436,"h":0.020894462846052786,"t":"neatly, organising their collection according time, but potentially, collecting has a lot","x":0.078114970944682893},{"y":0.53474676066394489,"h":0.017667844522968212,"x":0.076131684307718314,"c":1,"w":0.35185185750325521,"t":"to certain commonplace principles -"},{"w":0.11763980865478518,"y":0.53478529623145332,"h":0.019184548385853706,"x":0.50166653111273807,"c":1,"t":"going for it."},{"y":0.93604651144494633,"t":"21","h":0.013081395583944611,"w":0.024691357612609877,"x":0.88683127582332477,"c":1},{"y":0.9659578025343698,"c":1,"x":0.39470117618014106,"t":"leltsresources.org","w":0.20855322519938152,"h":0.018246100283062283}],"h":3395,"w":2400}